# `extract` returns a capture group (0 is the whole match), or null.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project a = extract(@'(\w)-(\d+)', 2, orderId), b = extract(@'\d+', 0, orderId), c = extract('z(.)', 1, orderId), d = extract('(o)', 5, orderId)
---- expected
a      | b      | c      | d
string | string | string | string
-------+--------+--------+-------
0001   | 0001   | null   | null
